---
description: Keep frontend-backend contracts and tests synchronized
globs:
  - backend/src/**/*.ts
  - frontend/src/sales-portal/**/*.ts
  - frontend/src/sales-portal/**/*.tsx
  - backend/tests/**/*.test.ts
alwaysApply: true
---

- API contract rule:
  - If backend response/request shape changes, update frontend `salesApi`, `types`, and zod schemas in same change.
- Search/filter parity rule:
  - Frontend must enforce backend query constraints before request where UX-relevant (e.g., minimum search length).
- Settings parity rule:
  - Keep portal settings keys/types in sync across backend and frontend.
- Test rule:
  - Add regression tests for each newly enforced invariant and each fixed bug branch.
  - Include negative-path assertions for auth and role checks.
- Quality gate rule:
  - Before merge, run backend tests and ensure no new lint/type issues in touched files.
